  "Delta": "<aside class="panel right" aria-label="Inspector"><div class="panel-head"><span>Construct</span></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="section"><div class="field"><label>Name</label><input class="input" maxlength="100" value="Delta"></div><div class="field"><label>Construct type</label><div class="segmented"><button class="on" title="Latent variable: indicators reflect the construct (ellipse)">Common factor</button><button class="" title="Emergent variable: a weighted combination of its indicators (hexagon)">Composite</button></div></div><div class="field"><label title="How this construct's indicator weights are estimated (each construct has its own mode)">Outer weights (this construct)</label><div class="segmented"><button class="on">Mode A (correlation)</button><button class="">Mode B (regression)</button><button class="" title="Equal weights on the standardised indicators (unit weights)">Sum scores</button><button class="" title="Weights you give, not estimated; rescaled so that the score has unit variance. Runs in the built-in engine">Pre-defined</button></div></div><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" checked=""><span><b>Categorical</b><br><span class="hint">d1’s k categories become k − 1 dummy variables (the first category is the reference) forming a composite (Mode B): the effect of group membership (Henseler 2021). Exogenous only.</span></span></label><div class="field"><label>Indicator side</label><div class="segmented"><button class="on" title="Indicators on the left" aria-label="Indicators on the left" aria-pressed="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="7" y="7" width="10" height="10" rx="2.5"></rect><path d="M3 6v12" stroke-width="3"></path></svg></button><button class="" title="Indicators on the top" aria-label="Indicators on the top" aria-pressed="false"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"