><div class="ind"><span class="vname">a3</span><span class="num muted" title="Loading"></span><button class="btn icon ghost sm" style="width: 24px; height: 24px;" aria-label="Remove a3"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="add-indicator"><div class="row2"><input class="input" placeholder="Add an indicator by name" aria-label="Indicator name" maxlength="64" value=""><button class="btn" disabled="">Add</button></div></div></div><div class="section"><div class="field"><label>Drawn as</label><div class="row2"><select class="select" aria-label="Shape"><option value="">Oval or circle (its type)</option><option value="rectangle">Rectangle</option><option value="octagon">Octagon</option></select><span style="display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center;"><input aria-label="Colour" type="color" value="#ffffff"></span></div></div><button class="btn danger"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h16M10 11v6M14 11v6"></path><path d="M6 7l1 12a2 2 0 002 2h6a2 2 0 002-2l1-12M9 7V4h6v3"></path></svg> Delete construct</button></div></div></aside>",
  "Beta": "<aside class="panel right" aria-label="Inspector"><div class="panel-head"><span>Construct</span></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="section"><div class="field"><label>Name</label><input class="input" maxlength="100" value="Beta"></div><div class="field"><label>Construct type</label><div class="segmented"><button class="" title="Latent variable: indicators reflect the construct (ellipse)">Common factor</button><button class="on" title="Emergent variable: a weighted combination of its indicators (hexagon)">Composite</button></div></div><div class="field"><label title="How this construct's indicator weights are estimated (each construct has its own mode)">Outer weights (this construct)</label><div class="segmented"><button class="">Mode A (correlation)</button><button class="">Mode B (regression)</button><button class="" title="Equal weights on the standardised indicators (unit weights)">Sum scores</button><button class="on" title="Weights you give, not estimated; rescaled so that the score has unit variance. Runs in the built-in engine">Pre-defined</button></div><label class="row2" style="align-items: center; margin-top: 4px;">b1<input class="input num" step="0.1" type="number" value="1"></label><label class="row2" style="align-items: center; margin-top: 4px;">b2<input class="input num" step="0.1" type="number" value="0.5"></label></div><div class="field"><label>Dominant indicator</label><select class="select"><option value="">None (sign as estimated)</option><option value="b1">b1</option><option value="b2">b2</option></select><div class="hint" style="margin-top: 4px;">Fixes the construct’s sign: its scores point the way this indicator does (loading positive), in the estimate and every bootstrap draw. cSEM and the built-in engine.</div></div><div class="field"><label>Indicator side</label><div class="segmented"><button class="on" title="Indicators on the left" aria-label="Indicators on the left" aria-pressed="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox=